'''886-1''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

